Cell["\<\
Preparation constructs inputs and loads any required libraries. Import \
fixtures are generated at the start of each case in the following cell, \
before import measurements. Missing executables are recorded and dependent \
cases are skipped. No installation is attempted.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f60316c2-bc4e-4280-b1ff-4e5ed4b67ca7"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["4. Run sequential measurements", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"e5ff77c2-e7d5-4358-9e16-92e6099d4d1c"],

Cell["\<\
For a new run, evaluate the preparation cell again first. Each prepared run \
can be executed once; previous reports are preserved.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"314e366e-c6c3-4efe-8813-452108a7a04f"],

